{"data":{"body":"[P2] Preserve terminal exports with supported core 2.4\u20132.6. Those versions satisfy the package's `>=2.4.0` peer range but do not supply `updatedOperations` or `onOperationChange`, so a deferred external completion reaches this hook as replayed with an empty pending map and its only terminal execution span is dropped. Either require core 2.7+ or detect missing completion metadata and retain the legacy export behavior; add an installed-2.6 deferred-completion regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs77Hlu4","finding_digest":"6202977ae383832f70e3d759ea541def0401a09ed2327e5da8de81a4a98272ae","finding_id":"arf_v1_mibjo6xdqobs64hd25m6uva554","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::executionotelplugin.onoperationend::legacy-core-replay-completion-loss","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::executionotelplugin.onoperationend::legacy-core-replay-completion-loss","line":575,"observation_digest":"fc7010171e1ba76a4cd831c5b103479335497ee2c4ffb504f7ccf2534c9e303e","observation_id":"aro_v1_7rybafy6dotwutgyghc3ca2hsm","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_mibjo6xdqobs64hd25m6uva554","published_at":"2026-10-07T23:29:47Z","review_id":"arr_v1_oav7zsfxapi5q2xi24oyvz5xin","reviewed_base_sha":"19ee19fa0619093943f079b69943f7b5cdee7ac7","reviewed_head_sha":"f4d177b0c0df3790ea32ab0f4cea09039fc09b01","reviewer":"codex","start_line":575,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":953},"record_id":"art_v1_xe63w6hm3rbnglamrllcox57oi","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T23:29:47Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
